4. Important things to know
There are a few gameplay details worth knowing before submitting:
Blackjack payout: A natural blackjack pays 2.5 times the original bet (including the returned stake).
Splitting: The player pays another bet to create a second hand.
Dealer rules: The dealer draws until reaching 17 or higher.
Aces: Your existing hand_total() function adjusts Aces from 11 to 1 when necessary.
One limitation: This is a basic split implementation. It does not yet handle every casino blackjack rule, such as splitting Aces only once or restricting blackjack payouts on split hands.
